{"title":"2022 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three positive integers are equally spaced on a number line. The middle number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62b477ff41e1b4c1050d4dd41bcea08de66eb9eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" /> and the largest number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the smallest number. What is the smallest of these three numbers? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f46b794dab70132f52da80dfa08f422e8d05b4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 7 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the smallest number be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc3be04db73828946870d3ccc6d122395a4bacf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> It follows that the largest number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fc12bfdc4e75f9637bacae2c3bfc7ef66dada30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/44847f7ba1999c24a1ea571355ae2d51ae1d2d51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,15,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> are equally spaced on a number line, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d43bd2bdcdb36b479c3ca2c103e33e0ce37fb5a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 4x-15 &amp;= 15-x \\\\ 5x &amp;= 30 \\\\ x &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 6}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"142\" height=\"78\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the common difference of the arithmetic sequence be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Consequently, the smallest number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad4ef10b124b20f7e2403f1683d02f4ff73c8350.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15-d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> and the largest number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/0416d2228043ede1995a76bb090dd8da27f7ae7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" />. As the largest number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the smallest number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/f/34ffd02dcf82dbea41ba64c8d3e6c2a26b423055.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+d=60-4d\\implies d=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"227\" height=\"16\" />. Finally, we find that the smallest number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/0/8a07765a13cb5f631b6b316c7c60a11d24a458f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15-9=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"131\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~MathFun1000\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the smallest number be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> are equally spaced from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> must be the average. By adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> and dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get that the mean is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f95dd6554fb59890d15e1e9b51b2a795bbb7d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />. We get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef8a439e5c0f2717142d8589356abbcc00159ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5x=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"78\" height=\"14\" />, and solving gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/5/07519b309721eda8fe6e01c8d0995ecc517ed9df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"92\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~DrDominic\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the problem is giving us the options, we can try all of them. The differences MUST be equal because the numbers have to be evenly spaced on the number line. We see that 4 cannot work because 15 - 4 = 11, and 4 * 4 = 16. 16 - 15 is not 11, so this option does not work. Next, we can try 5. We see that this also does not work because 15 - 5 = 10, and 5 * 4 = 20. 20 - 15 = 5, and this is not 10. We can then try 6 to see that it does work. 15 - 6 = 9, and 6 * 4 = 24. 24 - 15 = 9. The differences are equivalent, so we can see that 6 indeed does work. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3deeac91599ed7f0f2b06657dc240239c6fb81e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} ~6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"56\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~~Brainiacs77~~\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=681\">https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=681</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=bwDG0eKuI9uNqoOW&amp;t=677\">https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=bwDG0eKuI9uNqoOW&amp;t=677</a> \n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8PDJzeebmLw\">https://youtu.be/8PDJzeebmLw</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/1xspUFoKDnU\">https://youtu.be/1xspUFoKDnU</a>\n</p><p>~STEMbreezy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/evYD-UMJotA\">https://youtu.be/evYD-UMJotA</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ij9pAy6tQSg&amp;t=409\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ij9pAy6tQSg&amp;t=409</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fY87Z0753NI\">https://youtu.be/fY87Z0753NI</a>\n</p><p>~harungurcan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=